{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:1","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/10.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:10","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/2.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:2","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/3.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:3","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/4.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:4","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/5.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:5","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/6.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:6","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/7.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:7","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/8.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:8","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/16010521/9.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010521:1:9","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/menus/16010521_1_3.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_16010521:1:3","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:11031000:1":{"text":"어서 오세요! 찰리가 부른 마법사시죠?","source_cn":"你是查理请来的魔法师？欢迎！","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民罗宾":{"text":"마을 주민 로빈","source":"村民罗宾","status":"exact_hash"}}},"faction_dailies/menus/16010521_1_5.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_16010521:1:5","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:11036610:1":{"text":"야옹... 이상한 일이야, 이상한 일!","source_cn":"喵……怪事、怪事！","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:焦虑的猫咪":{"text":"걱정하는 고양이","source":"焦虑的猫咪","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/kr/ep6/quest_story/16231010.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16231010","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16231010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1623101001:1":{"text":"이상한 일... 이상한 일이 일어났습니다. 마법사님! 이상한 일이 일어났다고요!","source_cn":"怪事、怪事啊……魔法师大人，出怪事了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD314F26DC6521C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1623101002:1":{"text":"진정하고 천천히 말해보십시오.","source_cn":"先生，你先喘口气，别着急，慢慢说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x109B326D7EFD2206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623101003:1":{"text":"집에서 기르는 양이랑 말이 풀을 안 먹어요. 너무 이상하잖아요! 고양이랑 개도 겁에 질려서 꼼짝도 못 하고, 밤만 되면 귀신 들린 것처럼 울어대요!","source_cn":"太奇怪了，家里的羊和马都不吃草了！猫猫狗狗也都吓得不敢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB666EEB6FE65AA1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1623101004:1":{"text":"밀밭 근처를 한 바퀴 다 돌아봤는데도 원인을 못 찾겠더라고요. 그래서 혹시... 마법이랑 관련이 있지 않을까 싶어서요.","source_cn":"俺在麦田附近排查了一圈也没发现是怎么回事，所以就想……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAC0CC81052696E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1623101005:1":{"text":"아시잖아요. 저희 같은 마을 사람들은 마법에 대해 아무것도 모르는걸요... 혹시 봐주실 수 없나요?","source_cn":"俺们这些村民，你也知道……对魔法一窍不通，能麻烦你们去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02B5E8E77326A1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1623101006:1":{"text":"음... 동물들이 동시에 겁을 먹을 정도라면 평범한 일은 아닐 텐데...","source_cn":"唔……能让整群动物一起惊慌的，肯定不是普通事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8087511BAA224C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1623101007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 가서 살펴봐 주실 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26CCAF72270B84A0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 가서 살펴봐 주실 수 있겠습니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 가서 살펴봐 주실 수 있겠습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"218627","variant_female_record_index":"218628","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民查理":{"text":"마을 주민 찰리","source":"村民查理","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赫普":{"text":"헤플러","source":"赫普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep6/quest_story/16231020.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16231020","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16231020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1623102001:0":{"text":"밀밭 근처라... 음, 먼저 밀밭 주변부터 확인해 보자.","source_cn":"麦田附近……唔，我先去麦田周围看看吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEE24D11BA36A378C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"밀밭 근처라... 음, 먼저 밀밭 주변부터 확인해 보자.","female":"밀밭 근처라... 음, 먼저 밀밭 주변부터 확인해 보자.","variant_male_record_index":"218629","variant_female_record_index":"218630","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep6/quest_story/16231030.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16231030","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16231030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1623103001:0":{"text":"어쩌면 여기 주민들이 뭔가 더 알고 있을지도 몰라.","source_cn":"或许这里的村民们能发现一些什么。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x072F6F1A5A14D323","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어쩌면 여기 주민들이 뭔가 더 알고 있을지도 몰라.","female":"어쩌면 여기 주민들이 뭔가 더 알고 있을지도 몰라.","variant_male_record_index":"218631","variant_female_record_index":"218632","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep6/quest_story/16231050.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16231050","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16231050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1623105001:1":{"text":"낮에는 거의 움직이지도 않고, 먹지도 자지도 않아서 꼭 병든 것 같아요.","source_cn":"这群动物白天不怎么动，不吃也不睡，生病了一样。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E90FF7BF4D85C6C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"낮에는 거의 움직이지도 않고, 먹지도 자지도 않아서 꼭 병든 것 같아요.","female":"낮에는 거의 움직이지도 않고, 먹지도 자지도 않아서 꼭 병든 것 같아요.","variant_male_record_index":"218636","variant_female_record_index":"218637","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1623105002:1":{"text":"음... 그런데 밤만 되면 목을 빼고 울부짖으니, 뭔가에 놀란 것 같기도 하고요.","source_cn":"嗯……但一到晚上就扯着脖子喊，像是被什么东西吓到了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x72D5F4B4CE34D7FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"음... 그런데 밤만 되면 목을 빼고 울부짖으니, 뭔가에 놀란 것 같기도 하고요.","female":"음... 그런데 밤만 되면 목을 빼고 울부짖으니, 뭔가에 놀란 것 같기도 하고요.","variant_male_record_index":"218638","variant_female_record_index":"218639","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623105003:1":{"text":"정말 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어요. 마법사님이시죠? 혹시 동물들과 대화할 수 있나요?","source_cn":"我是拿它们没办法了。你是魔法师吧？你会不会和动物说话？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE85426D135255B0F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어요. 마법사님이시죠? 혹시 동물들과 대화할 수 있나요?","female":"정말 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어요. 마법사님이시죠? 혹시 동물들과 대화할 수 있나요?","variant_male_record_index":"218640","variant_female_record_index":"218641","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1623105004:1":{"text":"가능하다면 요즘 왜 이렇게 소란을 피우는지 직접 물어봐 주세요. 하아, 정말 머리가 아파 죽겠어요!","source_cn":"要是会的话，干脆就问问它们最近都在闹腾什么。唉，真让我...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCC1925E76C13C62D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"가능하다면 요즘 왜 이렇게 소란을 피우는지 직접 물어봐 주세요. 하아, 정말 머리가 아파 죽겠어요!","female":"가능하다면 요즘 왜 이렇게 소란을 피우는지 직접 물어봐 주세요. 하아, 정말 머리가 아파 죽겠어요!","variant_male_record_index":"218643","variant_female_record_index":"218644","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民罗宾":{"text":"마을 주민 로빈","source":"村民罗宾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村民汉克":{"text":"마을 주민 행크","source":"村民汉克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/e